         description='Given an array of tasks (represented as characters) and a cooldown period `n` (the same task type must wait at least `n` intervals before it can run again), return the minimum number of time units needed to finish all tasks, where each unit either runs one task or is idle.',
         constraints='1 <= len(tasks) <= 10^4; 0 <= n <= 100.',
